-*   **Empty Control Points:** Handle by inserting a default point [S7, unofficial].
-*   **Duplicate Positions:** Replace existing point or sort stably [S4, unofficial].
-*   **Zero Denominator:** If two control points have the same position, weight $w$ is undefined; treat as clamped [S7, unofficial].
-*   **Bin Misalignment:** Using different binning strategies for color and alpha (e.g., center vs. edge) causes slight misalignment at boundaries [S7, unofficial].
+*   **Empty Control Points:** Use a default black/zero point [S7, unofficial].
+*   **Out of Bounds Values:** Clamp to the nearest control point's value [S7, unofficial].
+*   **Precision:** Alpha values may be rounded to two decimal places in some implementations [S4, unofficial].
+*   **Binning Misalignment:** Using different binning strategies (center vs. edge) for color and alpha can cause slight misalignment at boundaries [S7, unofficial].
 
